              <paramref name="mode" /> is <see cref="F:System.IO.Compression.ZipArchiveMode.Update" />, but an entry is missing or corrupt and cannot be read.-or-
              <paramref name="mode" /> is <see cref="F:System.IO.Compression.ZipArchiveMode.Update" />, but an entry is too large to fit into memory.</exception>
