    <member name="M:System.Runtime.DurableInstancing.InstanceStore.CreateInstanceHandle(System.Runtime.DurableInstancing.InstanceOwner)">
      <summary>Creates an instance handle. If the instance owner passed as a parameter is not null, the value is automatically bound as the new handleâ€™s instance owner.  (Otherwise, no instance owner is bound, even if DefaultInstanceOwner is set.)</summary>
