          <see langword="true" /> if system-generated hidden fields are rendered at the top of the form; otherwise, <see langword="false" />. The default is <see langword="true." /></returns>
    </member>
    <member name="P:System.Web.Configuration.PagesSection.SmartNavigation">
      <summary>Gets or sets a value that indicates whether smart navigation is enabled.</summary>
      <returns>
          <see langword="true" /> if smart navigation is enabled; otherwise, <see langword="false" />. The default value is <see langword="false" />.</returns>
