    </member>
    <member name="F:System.Web.UI.WebControls.RepeatLayout.OrderedList">
      <summary>Items are displayed without a table structure. Ren†Ó␀€␀€dered markup consists of an <see langword="ol" /> element that contains <see langword="li" /> elements.</summary>
    </member>
