      <returns>The maximum number of <see cref="T:System.ServiceModel.InstanceContext" /> objects in the service at one time. The default is the sum of the value of <see cref="P:System.ServiceModel.Description.ServiceThrottlingBehavior.MaxConcurrentSessions" /> and the value of <see cref="P:System.ServiceModel.Description.ServiceThrottlingBehavior.MaxConcurrentCalls" />..</returns>
    </member>
    <member name="P:System.ServiceModel.Description.ServiceThrottlingBehavior.MaxConcurrentSessions">
